s IPO instead of chasing private markets, and what the next moves should be for the Federal Reserve after the latest inflation print. \n\nToday's panel includes Drew Pettit, Roundhill Investments' Chief Investment Strategist; Robert Schein, Blanke Schein Wealth Management's chief investment officer; and Christine Short, TMX Wall Street Horizon's Head of Corporate Event Research.","publisher":"Yahoo Finance Video","date":"2026-11-10T18:46:26Z","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/nvidia-in-the-hot-seat-anthropic-to-test-the-ipo-market-hotter-than-expected-us-inflation-184626512.html"},{"title":"Alleged plot to spy on Jensen Huang: Why it's bullish for AI.","summary":"Host Kevin Kelly, Kelly Intelligence Founder, CEO, and CCO, and his panel of experts weigh in on the alleged spy targeting Nvidia (NVDA) CEO Jensen Huang, which can be read as confirmation that the AI chip race between the US and China is real\n\nToday's panel includes Drew Pettit, Roundhill Investments' Chief Investment Strategist; Robert Schein, Blanke Schein Wealth Management's chief investment officer; and Christine Short, TMX Wall Street Horizon's Head of Corporate Event Research.","publisher":"Yahoo Finance Video","date":"2026-11-10T18:21:50Z","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/alleged-plot-to-spy-on-jensen-huang-why-its-bullish-for-ai-182150462.html"},{"title":"Top strategist: Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang's affair highlights key risk for tech companies","summary":"A new risk emerges for the S&P 500.","publisher":"Yahoo Finance","date":"2026-11-10T18:17:05Z","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/article/top-strategist-nvidia-ceo-jensen-huangs-affair-highlights-key-risk-for-tech-companies-184212599.html"},{"title":"Dow Jones Futures Rise As CoreWave Jumps, Lifts AI Stocks After Nvidia, Surging Yields Hit Stocks","summary":"Futures rose while AI stocks rallied overnight on CoreWeave earnings: The stock market fell on Nvidia and surging Treasury yields.","publisher":"Investor's Business Daily","date":"2026-11-11T02:26:41Z","url":"https://www.investors.com/market-trend/stock-market-today/dow-jones-futures-treasury-yields-nvidia-coreweave/?src=A00220&yptr=yahoo"},{"title":"Michael Burry Sees Nvidia Becoming ‘A Heck Of A Trade’ — Reveals His 2 Biggest Bets And Where He’s Buying More","summary":"MercadoLibre and Temple & Webster are his two largest positions, each accounting for over 10% of his portfolio.","publisher":"Stocktwits","date":"2026-11-11T02:20:08Z","url":"https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/equity/michael-burry-nvidia-outlook-stock-picks-2026-meli/cNGD7sxR9Jk"},{"title":"ESGU Trailed IVV by $26,370 on $300,000 Over Five Years. Its ESG Tilts Are Part of the Reason","summary":"Two funds from the same issuer share the same mega-cap giants at the top, yet their five-year results split sharply. The gap hides in fees, sector weights, and a screening process that can swing either way.","publisher":"24/7 Wall St.","date":"2026-11-11T02:03:59Z","url":"https://247wallst.com/investing/etf/2026/11/10/esgu-trailed-ivv-by-26370-on-300000-over-five-years-its-esg-tilts-are-part-of-the-reason/"},{"title":"Jensen Huang, pre-scandal, told Fortune Nvidia “could be of great service” to China","summary":"Jensen Huang’s dealings with China and views on U.S. export controls on advanced AI chips are under fresh scrutiny after the Nvidia CEO confessed to an affair with a woman U.S. intelligence agencies reportedly believe to be working as a spy for China.\n\nIn an interview with Fortune Senior AI Reporter Beatrice Nolan conducted before the allegations surfaced, Huang said that he thought the chipmaker “could be of great service” to China.","publisher":"Fortune","date":"2026-11-11T02:00:13Z","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/jensen-huang-pre-scandal-told-020013932.html"},{"title":"3 Magnificent Dividend Stocks Yielding 4% or More to Buy in November","summary":"These three blue chip dividend stocks offer higher yields while standing out in terms of dividend co